    questConnectionWaitingTitle:'Installation waiting for Quest connection.',questConnectionWaitingCopy:'The completed APK and transferred progress are retained. Installation waits for the same Quest and resumes automatically after authorization.',questConnectionWaitingNext:'Reconnect the same Quest to this PC with a USB data cable, switch it on and unlock it. Accept this PC’s USB debugging request in the headset if prompted. You do not need to restart installation.',questConnectionWaitingActivity:'Waiting for the Quest connection and authorization.',questGuideStartLiveWait:'Installation resumes automatically once the same Quest is connected and authorized again. Saved progress is retained; no restart is required.','phase_install-connection-wait':'Wait for Quest connection',
