    installationNext:'Resolve the displayed installation cause, then retry installation. The build is not repeated. You can also finish without installing; the completed APK is retained.',installationRetry:'Retry installation',installationSkip:'Finish without installing',
    questGuideTitle:'Prepare your Quest for installation',questGuidePower:'Turn on and unlock your Quest. If developer mode is not enabled yet, enable it for your Quest in the Meta Horizon smartphone app.',questGuideNetwork:'Connect the Quest to the PC with a USB data cable. USB installation does not require Wi-Fi. Without a cable, an already authorized Wi-Fi connection can be used.',questGuideAuthorize:'Accept this PC’s USB debugging request in the headset. Approving file access alone is not sufficient.',questGuideStart:'The wizard prefers USB and installs directly over the cable. If it is waiting for authorization, choose “Retry installation” afterwards. The completed APK and existing progress remain retained.',
    installationRunningTitle:'APK ready. Quest installation in progress.',installationRunningCopy:'The Quest version was built and checked successfully. The wizard connects your Quest and installs the completed files.',questGuideHelp:'Official Meta device setup instructions ↗',
    installationCleanTitle:'Continue clean installation.',installationCleanCopy:'The confirmed clean installation was interrupted. The finished APK and existing PC backups remain retained.',installationCleanAction:'Continue clean installation',installationCleanNext:'Keep the Quest connected and retry installation. The saved clean-install state resumes; old data is not replayed and the APK is not rebuilt.',installationCleanRunningTitle:'APK ready. Clean installation in progress.',installationCleanRunningCopy:'App data is removed as confirmed and the completed APK is installed. Existing PC backups remain retained and are not replayed.',
    installationRecoveryRunningTitle:'APK ready. Adapting installation automatically.',installationRecoveryRunningCopy:'The installed APK uses a different signature. The wizard backs up and verifies existing saves and settings before replacing the app, then restores them. Keep the Quest awake and connected.',
    installationSaveWaitTitle:'Installation paused: protect saves.',installationSaveWaitCopy:'The APK is ready. A save folder cannot currently be read.',installationSaveWaitAction:'Save access required',installationSaveWaitNext:'Current and archived saves and existing backups are retained. The app is not removed. Keep the Quest awake and connected and retry, or finish without installing.',
    installationDataChoiceTitle:'Installation paused: data choice required.',installationDataChoiceCopy:'The APK is ready. Choose how to handle inaccessible files outside save folders.',installationDataChoiceAction:'Choose how to handle other files',installationDataChoiceNext:'Saves and their stored history stay protected. “Keep saves and continue” retains all readable files; inaccessible files outside save folders, including diagnostic or settings files, will be lost. Alternatively retry preserving all files.',installationKeepSaves:'Keep saves and continue',installationRetryAll:'Retry preserving all files',
    installationRecoveryTitle:'APK ready. Safe recovery required.',installationRecoveryCopy:'The build is complete. Automatic signing recovery could not safely continue with the problem shown below. Retained backups and the completed APK are preserved.',installationRecoveryAction:'Signing recovery needs attention',installationRecoveryNext:'Keep the Quest awake and connected and retry installation. If the same cause remains, save the diagnostic package for a targeted repair. Keep retained backups; saved recovery resumes without rebuilding the APK. Do not uninstall the app manually.',installationRecoveryBackup:'Backup folder: {path}',
    installationRepairWaitTitle:'Installation paused: continue data backup.',installationRepairWaitCopy:'The APK is ready. A data backup could not yet be completed.',installationRepairWaitAction:'Check the Quest connection and retry',installationRepairWaitNext:'Safe transfer methods were tried automatically. Current and archived saves and completed backups are retained. Keep the Quest awake and connected and retry, or finish without installing.',
    installationRestoreWaitTitle:'Installation paused: open app storage.',installationRestoreWaitCopy:'The APK is ready and saves are backed up. Android has not yet made writable app storage available.',installationRestoreWaitNext:'Put on and unlock the Quest, keep it awake and connected, and retry. Only restoration resumes; the APK is not rebuilt and saves are not reset.',
